Tenaya NAO - Neutral Orcish Rogue - Illiterate & Racial[1]

[1] as defined by me: must wield or wear orcish items in the weapons
slot, cloak slot, suit slot, and helmet slot.  Wielding a pickaxe or a
lamp are exceptions.  I could have ditched the orcish chain and worn a
wished-for tee shirt but thought it would be more sporting to wear the
heavy suit.

